  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "冰將泮散，鳴雁雍雍。丁男長女，可以會同，生育賢人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c5ffa865a781a185f3e8a9edb1d2205f8654973301b92c7e1a985d5497deaed9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:53bfe02c4e529eabb7eff80439772091d2d3309a3f9906ac84d6d4ff4fa0f478"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "龍馬上山，絕無水泉。喉焦唇乾，口不能言。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4949a3e56c4670989f4b6bacec1167fd62b65a7de4f3fcf0e1a66fb71fbf1028",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d010ae76b76cf160d87ec34b4cdeb55162dc9588e17e638f91031de5e4f7b52"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "蔡侯朝楚，留連江濱。踰時歷月，思其后君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0ccbff86a2b273510805bd4b88fdd68627dc53a2511e2ed7f305cc4bf8d29511",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:db30a0aa49addfeab2c727d97ecd0405fccb39869f0927c9110fb39c97544ae0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "文厄羑里，湯囚夏臺。仁聖不害，數困何憂。免於縲絏，為世明侯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a22b464c64cd317ae8fea16cd24f6875963beba4a06e89a392ec408a330b334",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:703fcae3b53734421178530238afdc04dd1f20f5716efd6d5d606f08dbf4d7c6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "典冊法書，藏在蘭臺。雖遭亂潰，獨不遇災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7a6e3fff980f6c21e2a846a2cce8c109f716dbb2ccd3e6db683231eb68f2a495",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8ce7471177d1221f4b4531c3f3f8258292e4cd92fc1ebff5adec3c4325865e7c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "氈裘羶國，文禮不飭。跨馬控弦，伐我都邑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d5cbf2f9d5c831a086ddc3d675fc7450223d3293fac5edd35114aee8fb413dc9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c47f8cd27c3b8b882da8c5fa16ebf0f854bc4245691d81edeca4c695aafa938"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "星隕如雨，力弱無輔。強陰制陽，不得安土。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5923343303a027012c381226f11546c4f7431bce47da5415858e159c55d82139",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a99462298ae3d1149fd2fa867a5243993a06d621bd437575cc2abd9b05f44330"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "蝗囓我稻，驅不我去。實穗無有，但見空槁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7eac82d56b355d219ef3d70d251570efa357b00b27a450ab1dd2272761c3d48d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5913a226dfa3af6b08a304d06f4c877456ab0b45d729974170e752159e7e8b19"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "虎飢欲食，為蝟所伏。禹導龍門，避咎除患，元醜以安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2b52b098d757e5f94c7af1f90ec435d2af99d48e89395d29df46451ad19d99a5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e3e1a3492daf0d843f4c4cecf28110a6800aa702b3ddaebb298a757297d76c8a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "蝙蝠夜藏，不敢晝行。酒為酸漿，魴 鮑羹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:567dfd1cbbef698d11db6ec387b01e0cc1d6fdb5692103909b7c5f11637755b9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6cb60e33192a60b24fd0a4e44de045d4ab164063cc1d85382e5f9042a7bc816a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "精華墜落，形體醜惡。齟齬挫頓，枯槁腐蠹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:528188db85f67af0ced055bc41230dc611975cace1b82dbfaca681ec09f781a3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d0ac8ff17bcf16e4af666bf3a6fc6a22d388bced6a6988cbd062c47ea5efd2bd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "兩足不獲，難以遠行。疾步不能，後倡失時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:68cff7260a660d83112ac3bc7191756d5ea0e2125d6b1ed82bf8903a321f426a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c10ea1cd39299c703daca94461fc0c3e84834c8460495cf434e886ce1b803d30"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "令妻壽母，宜家無咎。君子之歡，得以長久。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:266629c6ac95a7066e81910e919310559fa95a16781c98987c70dd7c4cef582e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f2fad076825fcc692e06b9bc4e6e9e5b11f78a7b7631ec00317f03550421fc2d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "飢蠶作室，緡多亂纆，緒不可得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7fff7569f0769cf8944fa353214a9da167fba8271a7bb9670e9e473d321c653b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3cee22de457e605eee8e6bcce91228f1c08a8ff4493daadb18d7082e56aa3e5e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "子鉏執麟，春秋作經。元聖得終，尼父悲心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c4ad575eb2773941418dc31fd481aeffab8662eaa7e8146c4c5dd51abc6397ae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d67b2ea732da92ec8d8e997da3b61a7211756ab302c66191e8d1f1b3ee2613f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "螟蟲為賊，害我稼穡。盡禾殫麥，秋無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:573c73816ccf80ac23e4f4a3012edb07d1a68472441689e85d899270f2e6defb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:43f7e60fcaeeb18476f34e2311507bcde9c8ea7b950ac8fc808a8dad41e022e6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "憂在腹內，山崩為疾。禍起蕭牆，竟制其國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1b4622b701ad7b20554341eb06bccfb4edc3e1e22114c050051926b1a66cce29",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:92f3e35057b4e52c4ac8589b26d29350fd76ef70435ff2d102e74d460db80b7a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "茹芝餌黃，飲食玉瑛。神與流通，長無憂凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f7e28f040bcae7849e8d5b7983114e4e857284fe836923c0bccc9d07afc260f1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:781b5e920e5fb389c86c9887b20479fdb5480ae8d2f1a54301301d74a2a866a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "一夫兩心，技刺不深。所為無功，求事不成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:391a3a50e44dfa0edeaeb8064c67f5868c8eba8611cdfa69ce4886bb7c93f66a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:406babf4b8d4ac7807930331d0347f3c76d255fd6f6a483585928394fc68e5ac"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "十里望煙，散渙四方。形容滅亡，終不見君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e162dc47eced7607320cd6a213fdd485c90b222901176e07ae3cf57a53d3aca",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ef69838fd53dc256c26909d67c5faeed4e4845a2e15b7106001aaf1be3beb049"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "張弓控弩，經涉山道。雖有伏虎，誰敢害者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:00f0295341ca14be1d174afd3304b1d03deb2f47216a5ef6f25c7b390059b7b8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a8ab792f820bd8561f776ced6814e195820071a23b3fd578b2c8f463f64e96cf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "泉閉澤竭，主母飢渴。君子困窮，乃徐有說。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:33ab3579211ebf852a9383e87f3a2d9eb945c166b2da3dd05491c12aea2747ba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:508088cba9e93f94e1aa062fb14690a9c9cfc8874597cd1cd46c4fd7f9373161"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "野猿山鵲，弈棋六博。三梟四散，主人勝客。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a2118c8a1b71e48919954e00790dbd92885530bada2adb61ad84a06b1ece3614",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ed79f2b3c83ecd1d292b848d39c5c80d56edf4dc9b47e7b8cc039eded8300e5b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "羊驚馬走，上下揮擾。鼓音不絕，項公奔敗。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:656749696aa568446672ff000e4dd2bd55725008660df8f3d268e2c5475a13f0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c73e3d674d29c847a16f4f34a9a15226d24d6f70c691195e3745e2d9d5a75aa2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "黃帝神明，八子聖聰。俱受大福，天下平康。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4fce9a1e15f4df90d425f4a8d3687821d3f399f8156c5ec63f3aa2e5ef7dce27",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2fa07c54498c9c3a94ff93dcd1997e72dace3a9e9ff41c6337dc53d5605731e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "住馬醊酒，疾風暴起。泛亂福器，飛揚位卓。明神降佑，道無害寇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2f4515bb055f02c63e2d8f7aba2e8890c4420c4ce35396b629302d8d398f6d0b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d5797ba411d6bd1f4ff850afa56618cfb5a24956c09803fb7f7595006c4b839"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "騰蛇乘龍，宋鄭飢凶，民食草蓬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:64560124d4ef836dda7d1aa14f031e98efcc384889a5c65afd3db0b0cb821a2b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9f83fe4d62c660c04d7a6188e09aa2a0528bbbf5e30c67fc5331752bfb4fadc7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "揚水潛鑿，使石潔白。衣素表朱，遊戲皋澤。得君所欲，心志娛樂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:448ca18b42661d4a3ca427b3a860b4efeda34f9759927579e0b7cf33a665f05e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:555c3bfbd29800212b78e16cb8155bc7b06017554db068591f7d2a961cc78d29"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "西過虎廬，驚我前驅，雖憂無危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aecefe45df15e03e5de7f900ff5aa820254ce690caac1bf183992d4550c79248",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f4968f85f7d49571524ba56fe63bc0255239a3b65d23fbe9a76531b56d382472"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "衣成無開，不知所穿。客指東西，未得便安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5f0efa2838b62f59fc2c0b46e04eb3ebc370b4834791e8ba50582eab471d2ef3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:656c85a6f81ba92e4498a42c5a6c9ea86a25229f469131b741b9a36248b15ece"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "晨風文翰，隨時就溫。雌雄相和，不憂殆危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:64e8a9ab0ae81e396b5b43aebc78fe1a8d48a19f80137c4eaa9e83a833ba4f36",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cfb9dc8ce7a99b1115350fe8c23091060d4503295a37aab6b2e06f3ec7eaf772"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "心多悔恨，出言為怪。梟鳴室北，聲醜可惡。請謁不得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e3d5f867c499e12a1aca5f7b56b62d66c0562afd63ca6c7d541bb5f3fafbe4d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8696d6007dfea038ea0083a513fa1586ce65c635ffe416b73ce8b64e93158ce4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "離女去夫，閔思苦憂。齊子無良，使我心悲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c010282a7f3feae5dbe40e2a940159d71b3ba21b7a8adc0d10472b1b270a81ad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9cd9be08bf35469fcd169eef8fc53dec0f87fb873a90a31ab99e30d126c870b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "過時不歸，雌雄苦悲。徘徊外國，與叔分離。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b17136f6432ac2861e3219dfa889ff6bdc695a208aa3e88ff8811127bda62987",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d13c9ca6dee5df60af29b9e30182cd62894323cba978c336ff0bafc7d13f4618"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "鵲巢柳樹，鳩奪其處。任力德薄，天命不佑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:05c4761582b11f625aa282e54613ea1e9c66c68519dbeb5c2cbdf03fdbdc0d99",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5a4c6f57f06a26af926a2177ad743b30ccd0eb1b951b654aa97142e5bab5966b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "鶴盜我珠，逃於東都。鵠怒追求，郭氏之墟。不見蹤跡，使伯心憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aae6e32b595a75c51bb26b7ec669d2d63be6a825f4a57b7cdd3adc2318953ef8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c7bef59d9e0b80dc7f995078c8ce0baa6e756154c535a2f73266444ea32700b0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "夫婦相背，和氣弗處。陰陽俱否，莊姜無子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5b81310f423e859367f71933f3b7ec4330604ba51c0f5bc390e474a6b3f4bb75",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ce1b710ea349b85bcf1bb0c6b85bbc06d70654b8e224700ac6c30fe5c3e66120"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "月走日步，趣不同舍。夫妻反目，主君失居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1827323753919151131cb105857f67d61722e0892932eb40345274502880ddcb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2a0ec5ae049f1e87a786e6bf246d299da802d9f845eb43ae9b62b1e2221df1e0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "洛陽嫁女，善逐人走。三寡失夫，婦妒無子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1e4d9c27c5f4590a502682a09bd92a747426c7fde17c739844933f9888056d72",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5749733dc871cf9b421579a2fc8ffacc9c5ed1ff6f683c7d347325adc64a6ddb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "周德既成，杼軸不傾。太宰東西，夏國康寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9b87e821965914353d7ecf481423b2060e56a0baed72875a9f607acab45ab62c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f76eda2db907001869ff4730fd04f5bb4ae904c0136fcaf5c8887cdb539f53cd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "日中為市，交易資寶。名利所有，心悅以喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c9343715407acc1764760ea72e598bcf1314c42d4813039cb6b99d9a87e52b4f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3d8c1cd92c6fd236a59dc4662a346a2338fd11bda79142a3c171790efc096eb7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "僮妾獨宿，長女未室，利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a4e49bae403b95c9a9ec618977beae235fc7b94b61430fe91693312113113536",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c4c99e836d65d4af4c02f12eb3f76dbf936f49584a0fca8077429e17c41352f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "忠言輔成，王政不傾。公劉兆基，文武綏之。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dee23eb44d5e317bf1f4c2a88442313b578416e36f880cc2b2070ec7c94f3507",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c71b471438f136827a84f96108e78865a289b487c5ee662ca24f0f2116083d53"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "牛驥同堂，郭氏以亡。國破為墟，主君奔走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fbc6426d07289513d2eea2cef5f6706d5cf5d8a1dabf0754fabd8ed0eef24c08",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ae24422fab905c2dc4caabc41d476a6e9979ff293f35db009f5738cdce5f18e3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "中原有菽，以待雉食。飲御諸友，所求大得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a2b2701d21e328a7dbf363456e3182013ce12607a13b7992e831598377e8348",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2f9765d639cbdac467e4a6f66c2e411761340ffc1b830850c5fec0f960fa7cd4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "多虛少實，語不可知。尊空無酒，飛言如雨。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c3e09d8b460f4fa4d1a9f57e12b1a2fff1677ec615d7004edffe60bf910e4f64",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9e656417810ee2e84e1cd2f8a6e9a355d1a7cf4c05ff615d80ff234c502dbd8f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "青蠅集蕃，君信讒言。害賢傷忠，患生婦人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9bc6db538b78244bf97719b1b55d0ee1727a70367d6d746d752586272f533545",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7abe0f993783a93ebd0292f874d58e4d9b66964440c38ca961cbf3e95c64a8e8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "履株復輿，馬驚傷車，步為我憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6bdd3190b2d97801dc2a77c9e7dc70a6544fdc3212372b7aad329ca8b37aee25",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:21be05bcfd5a29a48c94720d3bf48ace2090ef61d044e3b589e24b6fcb737605"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "商風召寇，呼我北盜。間諜內應，與我爭鬥。殫己寶藏，主人不勝。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eb4eb0b08613abb4e2615995b10432affa61de951e9c62e4b5580fa1cd6cf748",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2f1de28ed597841936ae114ad207fe3dbb0ec42cc61b236d4e247334202b9e2c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "逸豫好遊，不安其家。或有少姬，久迷不來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dddf7364b43e1edf74d54ac0d7b3b710bd022ed8f1c283c9af80286302dc2563",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:741f6f5c18d34aa27d4763ba774327ac6623638aaae7101f6ffbe8b80fab4947"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "吾有驊騮，畜之以時。東家翁孺，來詣我車。價極可與，後無賊悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:76a217032c6893ed9f2cef426a2ff9165dae04f8d67d84337db9a242002aede1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d9837423386bf87deb41f43e4be5a1b1a07a7e314913b746033f04e17f29857e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "厄窮上通，與堯相逢。登升大麓，國無凶人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bb20a0e2b0c5aae449008d19df5ea291aab714846970f99a04e1fa1a15c0074c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:984b447f836e34ea5ae99d134a26d2cac84b96100984ebb8d4c2065f815553dc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "眾兔俱走，熊羆在後。騎不能進，失信寡處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:806e74e70d4c048d5f2902f75c0b76b7ea52328c73dfcc8cd7f20ab2693929cb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6a090d4e21211d60da3fbd753668eaf9f5bf87b128b415d7844b683400a6c533"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "旁行不遠，三思復返。心多畏患，日中止舍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:71c9854d21792f20556d899e4e397975042e6c45cc575cff1b01c03d2f2efc33",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bac446885f1ced37173b600062de70ed05a17c627429a13cbdec02afd90a17d7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "倉皇奉使，中山以孝。文侯悅喜，繫子徵召。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c6947b4b41cad8f3b5b8c9a96d2203a28b3dbc491fabd30934268a2a305e09f5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2941f1d693cb42a20b59f2b9ab9d6f5052c7c76ef907a97d2d6075a060dbd3f8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "入天門，守城戶。君安樂，不勞苦。文山蹲 ，肥腯多脂。王孫獲願，載福巍巍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ca9636f4b7ddd2f9d174118d0dec45b8cadb28933595bab8e90c4a2097c63377",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b85c83d4df54e864504fd3639c8ede9ea6ee0744499297d5903f09c3905b7457"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "登階上堂，見吾父兄。左酒右漿，與福相迎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bd23d37ba39c5affcb8cda0fbc2d8001e9978e52eeda9755d655686db7074883",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:976fc68518968631fed940e6c9c91fa031d24da44c55fc27c8e991aaaa9b8d4e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "秋蛇向穴，不失其節。夫人姜氏，自齊復入。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3423323fb9ca1e0f7832d3a11d25563ec588b41cc7a8c653efe1109307840d44",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4a6db575a3cc37ae149d58c7a6d0359c06cd86845904fe92915173d8ad11e03a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "忍醜少羞，有面無頭。耗減寡虛，日以削消。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e5521fbb438d26578df71cf4aa600d506d78e4964681273fe6ec6a9c1d4e74f3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:38cf628ec5beab9e25c6dd12113b2f0be8eea70d5110f6df9bde4066d347bbcf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "景星照堂，麟遊鳳翔。仁施大行，頌聲並興。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:77f43d3fdfa5cdaea383a83a5a5cbbc480d02ccb383e37443147336b65756c8b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b157612d07b6f2e4db15ba1b3322df6b21af7336bcfb47c70290672e4f50a285"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "干旄旌旗，執幟在郊。雖有寶珠，無路致之。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4569e2b31b9f4297997a797f48113166d7a088ffcccc0ec180232d8769e105b0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6edcb5d79b7c334c36303a2389bf5ab0e16b7147bc3ce28c78447f910ecbb85c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "李花再實，鴻卵降集。仁德以興，廕國受福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4c5732b5ca9dac6e6693c936186a5c37a6f00e33239f26219e042c2c6b828528",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d71295cea5a92a9c7c85eaa137bfd805224e101e139e24f3a123256d49c10d50"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "白鳥赤烏，戰於東都，敗悔為憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:88a93d71ae1a368d4ec7b95b68d09bda5b9304240d1bf56d4d72aa6a8d633c95",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5bab79967207a3ac6b1ba22426b52a79f2bd0f51197f9d7710c61018f6f82421"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 16,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "採薪得麟，大命殞顛。豪雄爭名，天下四分。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f9819ba9a9958e69b78bc96b76592dcd03c7dbe0c3d680f4862897672fc750d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e62e484274531486d8cb32eefb9233f609012154d67222d5c9a2ab4636ce4bd5"
    }
  ]
}
